  "definition": {
    "en": "Adobe's color management framework integrated into Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, and Acrobat — handles ICC profile assignment, conversion, and soft-proofing across the Creative Suite.",
    "nb": "Adobes fargestyrings-rammeverk integrert i Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign og Acrobat — håndterer ICC-profiltildeling, konvertering og soft-proofing på tvers av Creative Suite.",
    "de": "Adobes Farbmanagement-Framework, integriert in Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign und Acrobat — verwaltet die Zuweisung, Konvertierung und Soft-Proof-Vorschau von ICC-Profilen über die Creative Suite hinweg.",
    "ja": "Photoshop、Illustrator、InDesign、Acrobatに統合されたAdobeのカラーマネジメントフレームワーク — Creative Suite全体にわたるICCプロファイルの割り当て、変換、ソフトプルーフを処理する。",
    "es": "Sistema de gestión de color integrado en las aplicaciones Adobe Creative Cloud, basado en perfiles ICC y configuraciones de color compartidas entre Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign y Acrobat.",
    "zh-Hans": "集成在Adobe Creative Cloud应用程序中的色彩管理系统，基于ICC配置文件和Photoshop、Illustrator、InDesign及Acrobat之间共享的色彩设置。",
    "sv": "Adobes färghanteringsramverk integrerat i Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign och Acrobat — hanterar tilldelning av ICC-profiler, konvertering och skärmprovtryck genom hela Creative Suite.",
    "da": "Adobes farvestyringsramme integreret i Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign og Acrobat — håndterer tildeling af ICC-profiler, konvertering og soft-proofing på tværs af Creative Suite.",
    "nl": "Adobes kleurbeheerraamwerk, geïntegreerd in Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign en Acrobat — verzorgt ICC-profieltoewijzing, conversie en soft-proofing door de hele Creative Suite.",
    "pl": "Framework zarządzania barwą Adobe zintegrowany z Photoshopem, Illustratorem, InDesignem i Acrobatem — obsługuje przypisywanie profili ICC, konwersję i soft-proofing w całym pakiecie Creative Suite.",
    "pt": "Quadro de gerenciamento de cor da Adobe integrado ao Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign e Acrobat — trata atribuição de perfil ICC, conversão e prova de tela em toda a Creative Suite.",
    "hi": "Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign और Acrobat में एकीकृत Adobe का रंग प्रबंधन ढाँचा — पूरी Creative Suite में ICC प्रोफ़ाइल असाइनमेंट, रूपांतरण और सॉफ़्ट-प्रूफ़िंग संभालता है।"
  },
  "creator": "https://ptpge.org/contributors/ptpge",
